{"id":"5050","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5050_main_cumulonimbus-with-arcus_clouds-hydrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>积雨云是沉重的、密集的云，具有相当大的垂直范围，呈现山或巨大的塔的形式。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云的下面通常很暗</span>。弧状附加特征是该图像中最受关注的。弧状云是云前下部的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密集水平云卷</span>，当面积广泛时，具有黑暗、威胁性拱形的外观。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">前缘可以具有光滑的外观</span>，但边缘则是或多或少的不规则。在这张照片中，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">下面是不规则的</span>。弧状云是由强冷空气下降气流形成的，冷空气在暴风云之前蔓延开来。在远处也可以看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">阵雨形式的降水性</span>附加功能。在头顶上有一层厚厚的积雨云性蔽光高层云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Petter Hjulstad","location":"挪威Inderøy","latitude":"纬度: 63° 52' 46'' N","longitude":"经度: 11° 13' 41'' E","date":"11 August 2015 1825 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 2, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.10.7","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.10.7"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5050_syn_cumulonimbus-with-arcus_clouds-hydrometeors.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>锢囚锋正从西南方向接近挪威的Inderøy。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇冠版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5050_upper_cumulonimbus-with-arcus_clouds-hydrometeors.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>西南偏西90公里的探测 - 低层有条件的不稳定，中层则非常潮湿</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5050_sat_cumulonimbus-with-arcus_clouds-hydrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>在挪威Inderøy西南部的海岸线上可以看到一系列积雨云细胞。该云线经过Inderøy并在接下来的三个小时内消散。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2014","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/6058_main_cumulonimbus-with-arcus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>这张照片中的主要特征是弧状附加特征，通常被称为板架云，在积雨云和雷暴的前缘上推进。</p>\n<p>积雨云是浓厚的云，垂直厚度相当大，呈山脉或巨塔状。云的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">下面通常非常阴暗</span>。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">弧状云是一个浓密的水平卷轴，位于云的前下部</span>，如果范围大，便呈<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">阴暗恐怖的弧状</span>。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">前沿部分平滑</span>，但边缘有些破烂。弧状云的形成是由于冷空气的强下曳气流，它在风暴云前面扩散。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Shelby E. Fuller","location":"美国，宾夕法尼亚州，米勒斯维尔","latitude":"纬度: 39° 59' 43'' N","longitude":"经度: 76° 21' 14'' W","date":"26 March 2015 1857 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= /, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: S.10.7","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.10.7"},{"src":"/images/compressed/6060_main_cumulonimbus-with-arcus-and-praecipitatio_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>积雨云浓密厚重，垂直厚度相当大，呈山脉或巨塔状。</p>\n<p>这张照片中的主要特征是弧状附加特征。弧状云是一个浓密的水平卷轴，位于云前下部，如果范围大，便呈现<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">阴暗恐怖的弧状</span>。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">前沿部分平滑</span>，但边缘有些破烂，且<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云的底面通常破碎</span>。弧状云的形成是由于冷空气的强下曳气流，它在风暴云前面扩散。</p>\n<p>照片中还可看到阵雨式的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">降水性</span>附加特征。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Amy Chan","location":"中国，香港，赤鱲角","latitude":"纬度: 22° 18' 18'' N","longitude":"经度: 113° 53' 52'' E","date":"24 August 2011 1821 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= /, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: S.10.7","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.10.7"}]}]}